{"id":"input-f9e7a686c0fa","steamAppId":"1941410","name":"The Cub","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1941410/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1941410/","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":11.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"11 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","steamTags":["Singleplayer","Post-apocalyptic","Story Rich","Precision Platformer","Soundtrack","Dystopian","Adventure","Atmospheric","Exploration","Puzzle","Comic Book","Platformer","Colorful","Puzzle Platformer","Controller","2D Platformer","Stylized","Arcade","2D","Difficult"],"sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"From the creators of Golf Club Nostalgia and Highwater. Return to their whimsical, neon-lit apocalypse in a Jungle Book meets The Armageddon fusion. Parkour through the remains of humanity as a child being hunted, while catchy end-of-days tunes and curious survivor stories play on the radio.","developers":["Demagog Studio"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:20:17.367124+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"From the creators of Golf Club Nostalgia and Highwater. Return to their whimsical, neon-lit apocalypse in a Jungle Book meets The Armageddon fusion. Parkour through the remains of humanity as a child being hunted, while catchy end-of-days tunes and curious survivor stories play on the radio."},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Từ những người sáng lập câu lạc bộ golf Nostalgia và Highwater. Trở về với sự tận thế phi thường và độc đáo của họ trong một cuốn sách rừng gặp sự kết hợp giữa Ha - ma - ghê - đôn. Xây dựng cơ thể con người khi còn là một đứa trẻ bị săn đuổi, trong khi những giai điệu cu